    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "It’s that time of year again—when Hugh takes on a totally wacky challenge to prove his love for GCTC (and help raise funds while he’s at it). Last year, you helped us  blow past  our $10K goal, so this year we’re going bigger:  $15,000 .  After 2024’s Hugh-kulele-run-a-thon, the stakes were high. So"
