    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Small Fish  March 14 &amp; 15, 2025 at 8:00 PM  The 18X SOLD OUT comedy and variety show by and for marginalized folks is coming to GCTC for two nights only!  What to Expect?   Improv. Music. Standup. Sketch. Dolly Parton. Lasers. Horses.  This is a MASKS REQUIRED event.  Small Fish are:  Maggie"
      }
