        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "We’d love to have you join us to decorate and upcycle a tote bag, listen to some beats, all while sipping on local craft beer.    August 14, 5:30-7:30 pm  In the GCTC Lobby at 1233 Wellington St. W.     Tickets are $20  Price includes a tote bag and all decorating materials  Craft beer (alcoholic an"
