        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "FemmeVox 6  Sun, Oct 06, 2024 8:00 PM  A concert series featuring established and emerging singer-songwriters. Artists work together in pairs to write brand new compositions to premiere at each concert.&nbsp;   Featuring:     Tara Holloway    Catriona Sturton    Empress Nyiringango    Naviger"
