      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Welcome to  Bowl-o-ween , a thrilling event brought to you by the Great Canadian Theatre Company with the generous support of our Board’s Artists Committee.  Join&nbsp;a team for an exciting evening of fundraising, bowling, and Halloween fun, or show your support by making a donation.  And join"
