    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "In collaboration with CKCU, CHUO and the Ottawa Music Industry Coalition, the GCTC presents FemmeVox, a concert series featuring established and emerging singer-songwriters. FemmeVox is unique in that it pairs up artists resulting in surprisingly creative new songs. The compositions are then present"
