    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "To close out International Women’s Month, GCTC and Origin Arts present Haviah Mighty, streaming live from Ottawa.  Haviah won the Polaris Prize for her 2019 album  13th Floor , making her the first hip-hop artist and the first Black woman to do so. She is widely regarded as one of the most influenti"
