        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Come see Ottawa's finest musical theatre talent perform popular duets, trios and group numbers from Broadway shows. &nbsp;&nbsp;  There's just one catch: They don't know who they are performing with until the moment the show begins."
      }
