    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "CCLA/GCTC Lawyer Play 2026:  Our Town  by Thornton Wilder directed by Hugh Neilson  April 15 - 18, 2026  Thornton Wilder’s beloved classic about everyday life, love, and the beauty we often miss while we’re busy living it.  Watch it unfold on the GCTC Mainstage, May 22-25, 2024."
      }
