        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Soleimanpour’s show invites us to experience how we shape our ideas about people through the stories we tell. Shout, laugh, gasp and collaborate with fellow audience members to write a story that is unique to the people assembled and will never be repeated.   A heart-warming tour de force. A communi"
