      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Clever, organized, devious &amp; daring—they stole from the rich and gave to themselves.  This is the riveting story of the all-female gang which terrorized London for over 100 years. “Right here, right now, for one night only, I’ll tell you something special I ain’t never told no one before; I’"
