        "@value": "On Saturday August 19th, 2023, GCTC and Propeller Dance will premiere CARRYING EACH OTHER  FINDING OURSELVES — a documentary about Rob Chartier’s artistry as a professional dancer and community leader within Propeller Dance since its inception in 2007."
      }
    ],
