      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "From the partnership that brought you Haviah Mighty and The Journey comes a new event in honour of Black History Month:\n\nMIC Drop: A Black Legacy and History Celebration, brought to you by GCTC and The Origin Arts and Community Centre. This event will be taking place Sunday, February 27th 4-6pm."
