      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "“Blissful State of Surrender” is a dramatic comedy about a Bosnian-Canadian family and the larger-than-life culture clashes between the parents and their three grownup daughters. This humorous and haunted portrait of the Muslim refugee experience explores the lives of a family coping with family sec"
      }
    ],
