    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "A Canadian premiere based on true events, “Daisy” tells the story of the Madison Avenue advertising team that set out to create the first modern political attack ad for the 1964 presidential campaign of Lyndon Johnson. Infamously known as the “Daisy ad,” it ran once and was immediately banned, but i"
